<para>Finish.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>Serialized binary representation of all encoded values.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Nesting safety: Incomplete array/object nesting (unmatched begin/end calls) produces an internally consistent buffer but may fail decoding. Validate with <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_serialization_1_1_decoder" kindref="compound">Decoder</ref> after encoding.</para>
</simplesect>
